{"title": "Web Walker", "pageid": 4412, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Web_Walker", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Venomous_Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Venomous_Bite.webp/300px-Venomous_Bite.webp, /w/images/8/81/Venomous_Bite.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Venomous_Bite.webp/300px-Venomous_Bite.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Venomous_Bite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Web Walker</b> is a passive feature inherent to a number of spider-like creatures in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Isn't slowed down by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Web_(surface)\" title=\"Web (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Web_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Web_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Web_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Web\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Web_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Web_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Web_(surface)\" title=\"Web (surface)\">Web</a> surfaces, and can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enwebbed_(Condition)\" title=\"Enwebbed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enwebbed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Enwebbed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enwebbed_(Condition)\" title=\"Enwebbed (Condition)\">Enwebbed</a> by them. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Beast_Master\" title=\"Beast Master\">Beast Master</a></li></ul>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aggressive_Crag_Spider\" title=\"Aggressive Crag Spider\">Aggressive Crag Spider</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aranea\" title=\"Aranea\">Aranea</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aranea_Aculeata\" title=\"Aranea Aculeata\">Aranea Aculeata</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Aranea_Major\" title=\"Aranea Major\">Aranea Major</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Combustion_Belly_Spiderling\" title=\"Combustion Belly Spiderling\">Combustion Belly Spiderling</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Conjured_Spider_(Find_Familiar)\" title=\"Conjured Spider (Find Familiar)\">Conjured Spider (Find Familiar)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Conjured_Spider_(Shooting_Spider_Companion)\" title=\"Conjured Spider (Shooting Spider Companion)\">Conjured Spider (Shooting Spider Companion)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Crag_Spider\" title=\"Crag Spider\">Crag Spider</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ettercap\" title=\"Ettercap\">Ettercap</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Spider\" title=\"Giant Spider\">Giant Spider</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Larger_Giant_Spider\" title=\"Larger Giant Spider\">Larger Giant Spider</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lur_Fu\" title=\"Lur Fu\">Lur Fu</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lur_Jox\" title=\"Lur Jox\">Lur Jox</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lur_Otan\" title=\"Lur Otan\">Lur Otan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lur_Xanta\" title=\"Lur Xanta\">Lur Xanta</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider\" title=\"Phase Spider\">Phase Spider</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spider_Matriarch\" title=\"Phase Spider Matriarch\">Phase Spider Matriarch</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Phase_Spiderling\" title=\"Phase Spiderling\">Phase Spiderling</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sharran_Spider\" title=\"Sharran Spider\">Sharran Spider</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Smaller_Giant_Spider\" title=\"Smaller Giant Spider\">Smaller Giant Spider</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sword_Spider\" title=\"Sword Spider\">Sword Spider</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p>See Also:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Spider Step: <a href=\"/wiki/Spiderstep_Boots\" title=\"Spiderstep Boots\">Spiderstep Boots</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Not slowed or <a href=\"/wiki/Enwebbed_(Condition)\" title=\"Enwebbed (Condition)\">enwebbed</a> by web surfaces.</div>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201044\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1002/1000000\nPost‐expand i